      <data key="e_comment_id">UgyY8LuG6YRKqUOqWYF4AaABAg</data>
      <data key="e_edge_type">comment</data>
      <data key="e_vosonTxt_comment">After months, I finally found the song. 

Remembering the tune of the first verse, as well as a vague memory of the lyrics of the chorus, I tried humming it on Shazam and Google Search a Song. 
This is what I’ve attempted for the past two days, to no avail. 

The song came back to my mind moments ago. 
Going for a new attempt, I searched “thats nice like you” here on YouTube. 
None of the results matched what I was looking for. 
I then searched “thats nice like you im so grateful” then found this. Seeing the title and thumbnail, I had a feeling this was the one. And I was right. 


Finally.</data>
